          Find Your <span style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b9d, #ee7a52); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text;">Perfect Match</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="lead mb-5" style="font-size: 1.3rem; opacity: 0.95;">
          🎉 Honey Matrimony is here! Your trusted platform to find your life partner. Join thousands of happy couples who found love through us.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex gap-3 flex-wrap">
          <a href="<%= new_signup_path %>" class="btn btn-light btn-lg fw-bold px-5" style="border-radius: 50px; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);">
            <i class="bi bi-heart-fill text-danger me-2"></i>Start for Free
